  description: A branching stem strung with translucent, soap-film orbs of different
    sizes, each one wobbling and catching the light like it might pop on its own
    at any moment. Pop one against your own pack rather than a plant and somehow
    there's simply more room inside than there was a moment ago.
  descriptionSecondary: ' Consumed on yourself, not a pot.  Expands your inventory
    grid by one row, with anything already waiting slotted in automatically.'
